@startuml seq-avancement-terrain
title Diagramme de séquence -- Soumettre un avancement terrain

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor       #2C5282
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C5282
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor    #2C5282
    ActorBackgroundColor      #FAFAFA
    ActorBorderColor          #2C5282
}

actor "Installateur"    as User
actor "Admin"           as AdminUser
participant "Frontend\nMobile/Web"          as FE
participant "API Gateway"                    as GW
participant "FieldUpdateController"          as FUC
participant "FieldUpdateService"             as FUS
participant "NotificationWebSocketService"   as NWS
participant "ProjectRepository"              as PR
database  "PostgreSQL"                       as DB
participant "STOMP Broker"                   as BROKER

User -> FE : Choisir statut\n(SUR_SITE, EN_INSTALLATION...)
User -> FE : Renseigner avancement %\n+ note
FE   -> GW : POST /api/projects/{id}/field-updates\n(JWT, body)
GW   -> FUC : Forward + headers
FUC  -> FUS : submitFieldUpdate(req)
FUS  -> PR  : findById(projectId)
PR   -> DB  : SELECT * FROM projects
DB  --> PR  : Project
PR  --> FUS : Project

FUS  -> FUS : Valider ownership\n(installerId == userId)
FUS  -> DB  : INSERT INTO field_updates
DB  --> FUS : FieldUpdate(id)
FUS  -> PR  : update project.currentProgress\n+ currentFieldStatus
PR   -> DB  : UPDATE projects SET ...
DB  --> PR  : OK

FUS  -> BROKER : send to /topic/field-updates/{id}
FUS  -> NWS : notifyUser(adminId, "Avancement terrain")
NWS  -> DB  : INSERT INTO notifications
NWS  -> BROKER : send to /user/{adminId}/queue/notifications

BROKER --> AdminUser : push notification

FUS --> FUC : FieldUpdateDTO
FUC --> GW  : 201 Created + JSON
GW  --> FE  : 201 + DTO
FE  --> User : Confirmation\n+ projet rafraîchi

alt Blocage signalé
    FUS -> NWS : notifyUser(adminId, "BLOCAGE")
    NWS -> BROKER : push urgent
end

@enduml
